.md still says "Status: scaffolding … parent `pending`" with the pre-spec tool names — stale relative to the done state; recommend refreshing at session close (current.md/history.md closure step). The `except A, B:` unparenthesized form in the adapters is PEP 758 (valid on the py314-only toolchain; the documented reason harness/tools is ruff-excluded) — not a defect.
